*begin CrescentPot

*export Entrance

;Title: Crescent Pot

;Date Created 16/06/2013 by Becka Lawson

;All Crescent Pot files

*cs OSGB:SD
*cs out EPSG:27700
*DECLINATION AUTO 70545 76594 393

*fix GPS 70545 76594 393 ;to peaty "step" near top of shakehole, just above steps - entrance GPS by Becka with Becka's Etrex Venture GPS read to 3m accuracy on 16 June 2013

*ENTRANCE 	Entrance
*equate 	Entrance crescent_1.2

*equate GPS crescent_1.gps

*include crescent_1
*include crescent_2
*include crescent_3
*include crescent_4
*include crescent_5
*INCLUDE Crescent-Recon1   ; this is reconstructed centreline for Preston 1974-1979 survey taking their "Grid North" arrow at face value
*INCLUDE Crescent-Recon1-AddSomeDegreesCW ; this is reconstructed centreline for Preston 1974-1979 survey but assuming they
; mistakenly subtracted (rather than added) the approx -8 degree declination for their survey when they drew up their plan

*equate crescent_1.14	crescent_2.1
*equate crescent_3.10x	crescent_2.10
*equate crescent_3.8	crescent_2.2-1
*equate crescent_3.8	crescent_4.8x
*equate crescent_4.25	crescent_5.25x
;*EQUATE crescent_5.26	Crescent-Recon1.path8.33
*EQUATE Entrance		Crescent-Recon1.path9.40
*EQUATE Entrance		Crescent-Recon1-AddSomeDegreesCW.path9.40

*end CrescentPot
